      <div class="acc">
            <details open><summary>{{ section.settings.s8 }}</summary><div class="body">As he slipped into the pew, he noted how soft the wood felt beneath his fingers, polished and worn from so many years of human touch. But the music was the same. The cool, oaky air of the church was the same. The smell—ageing paper, freshly mown grass—just the same. As much as time was hurtling by, it felt in the moment that nothing had changed. <br><br>Story II, in nine pages, printed and boxed with the bottle; the digital edition arrives with your confirmation.</div></details>
