            <details><summary>{{ section.settings.s14 }}</summary><div class="body">Verde Jade, Rajasthan, hand-cut. Veining is decided by the block, so no two lids repeat. The lid lifts free of the glass and keeps its weight in the hand.</div></details>
            <details><summary>{{ section.settings.s15 }}</summary><div class="body">Complimentary UK delivery over &pound;30, otherwise &pound;5. Two to four working days, signed for. FILLER &mdash; returns window to come. Samples are non-returnable.</div></details>
